        ],
        "operationId": "UpdateConfiguration",
        "summary": "修改参数模板参数",
        "description": "修改参数模板参数。",
        "x-support-sdk": "Y",
        "x-constraint": "- MySQL:仅支持5.6,5.7。\n- Microsoft SQL Server:仅支持2014 SE、2014 EE、2016 SE、2016 EE、2008 R2 EE、2008 R2 WEB、2014 WEB、2016 WEB。\n- 修改参数模板名称“name”不能与默认参数模板或已有参数模板的名称重复,默认参数模板不允许修改。\n- 修改的参数必须在指定数据库版本的默认参数范围内,具体可配置范围请参见《关系型数据库用户指南》中“编辑参数模板”的内容。\n- 敏感参数,例如:“lower_case_table_names”,修改存在风险,详情请参见《关系型数据库用户指南》中“MySQL参数修改注意事项”的内容。\n- 要修改的参数信息,不可全部为空。",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "x-auth-token",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "用户Token。",
            "type": "string",
            "x-example": "******"
          },
          {
            "name": "X-Language",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "语言",
            "type": "string",
            "x-example": "zh-cn"
          },
          {
            "name": "project_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "项目ID。",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "x-example": "619d3e78f61b4be68bc5aa0b59edcf7b"
          },
          {
            "name": "config_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "参数模板ID。",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "UpdateConfigurationRequestBody",
            "in": "body",
            "description": "请求体。",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/ConfigurationForUpdate"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Success.",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/UpdateConfigurationRsp"
            }
          },
          "default": {
            "description": "Client or server error.",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/ErrorResponse"
            }
          }
        },
        "x-request-examples-description-1": "",
        "x-request-examples-url-1": "PUT https://rds.cn-north-1.myhuaweicloud.com/v3/054e292c9880d4992f02c0196d3ea468/configurations/463b4b58-d0e8-4e2b-9560-5dea4552fde9",
        "x-request-examples-1": {
          "name": "configuration_test",
          "description": "configuration_test",
          "values": {
            "max_connections": "10",
            "autocommit": "OFF"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "definitions": {
    "ErrorResponse": {
      "required": [
        "error_code",
        "error_msg"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "error_code": {
          "description": "错误码。",
          "type": "string",
          "example": "DBS.200022"
        },
        "error_msg": {
          "description": "错误消息。",
          "type": "string",
          "example": "实例名称已存在。"
        }
      }
    },
    "ConfigurationForUpdate": {
      "properties": {
        "name": {
          "description": "参数模板名称。最长64个字符,只允许大写字母、小写字母、数字、和“-_.”特殊字符。",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "description": {
          "description": "参数模板描述。最长256个字符,不支持>!<\"&'=特殊字符。默认为空。",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "values": {
          "description": "参数值对象,用户基于默认参数模板自定义的参数值。为空时不修改参数值。\n\n- key:参数名称,\"max_connections\":\"10\"。为空时不修改参数值,key不为空时value也不可为空。\n- value:参数值,\"max_connections\":\"10\"。",
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "example": {
            "max_connections": "10"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "UpdateConfigurationRsp": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "更新参数模板的结果",
      "properties": {
        "configuration": {
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "参数模板ID。"
            },
            "name": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "参数模板名称。"
            },
            "ignored_params": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "description": "请求参数“values”中被忽略掉,没有生效的参数名称列表。\n当参数不存在时,参数修改不会下发,并通过此参数返回所有被忽略的参数名称。"
            }
          },
          "description": "参数模板信息"
        }
      }
    }
  },
